OL,3,GNEWSAChristian 'discriminated' in job
OL,4,Aretraction - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christian social worker was
OL,7,Fdiscriminated against by being made to
OL,8,Fattend a second job interview over his
OL,9,Freligious beliefs on homosexuality, the
OL,10,FCourt of Appeal has been told.
OL,12,FFelix Ngole, from Barnsley, attended an
OL,13,Finitial interview with the Touchstone
OL,14,FLeeds mental health charity in 2022 for
OL,15,Fa job in a hospital in Wakefield, West
OL,16,FYorkshire.
OL,18,FTouchstone retracted a job offer a
OL,19,Fmonth later after learning about news
OL,20,Farticles relating to a previous court
OL,21,Fcase Ngole had been involved in.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
